ent": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Compl\u00e9tez les \u00e9tapes suivantes. Remplissez la grille d'auto-\u00e9valuation. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "frn5le07ob08re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le07ob08re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le07ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le07ob08re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le07ob08re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Cher journal,</br></br>Je suis tr\u00e8s \u00e9motive en ce moment.  Marco est un gars incroyable sur beaucoup d'aspects. Nous sommes all\u00e9s voir un film la semaine pass\u00e9e. On a vu <span class=\"italic\">La Cage Dor\u00e9e</span>.  Je n'avais jamais autant ri en regardant un film."}, {"time": "14000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "En revanche, je n'ai pas ri lorsque Marco a tr\u00e9buch\u00e9 dans les escaliers et a renvers\u00e9 du pop-corn partout ! Apr\u00e8s, nous avons achet\u00e9 de la glace et Marco m'a invit\u00e9e \u00e0 son appartement. J'ai eu un aper\u00e7u de ses go\u00fbts en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9coration.  Pendant que j'admirais sa lampe, j'ai appris qu'il avait une s\u0153ur, Francesca."}, {"time": "33000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Tout se passait bien jusqu'au moment o\u00f9 Marco a commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 se moquer de moi. J'ai pens\u00e9 qu'il avait peint un tableau de Picasso. Il \u00e9tait mort de rire. J'\u00e9tais tellement f\u00e2ch\u00e9e et g\u00ean\u00e9e. Il m'\u00e9nerve&nbsp;! J'esp\u00e8re qu'il s'excusera bient\u00f4t.</br></br>Coraline"}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 3, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le07ob08re5img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le07ob08re5aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Qu'est-ce que l'on \u00e9crit dans un journal intime ?"}, {"time": "5000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"time": "10000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img04.jpg", "id": 3, "text": ""}, {"time": "12000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img05.jpg", "id": 4, "text": ""}, {"time": "23000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img06.jpg", "id": 5, "text": ""}, {"time": "36500", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img07.jpg", "id": 6, "text": ""}, {"time": "41000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img08.jpg", "id": 7, "text": ""}, {"time": "49000", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img09.jpg", "id": 8, "text": ""}, {"time": "53500", "image": "frn5le07ob08re5img10.jpg", "id": 9, "text": ""}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}